---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Terms of Service - Daily Prompt Hack',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="px-6 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20 mx-auto max-w-4xl">
    <header class="mb-8 md:mb-12 text-center">
      <h1
        class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-tighter tracking-tighter mb-4 font-heading dark:text-gray-200"
      >
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-muted dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">Last updated: October 21, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div
      class="mx-auto prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed space-y-6"
    >
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing <strong>Daily Prompt Hack</strong> (<a
          href="https://prompt.storydailyview.com"
          class="text-primary hover:underline">https://prompt.storydailyview.com</a
        >), you agree to comply with these terms of service, all applicable laws and regulations, and acknowledge that
        you are responsible for compliance with any applicable local laws. If you do not agree with any of these terms,
        you are prohibited from using or accessing this site.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">2. AI & Generative Output Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        The prompt blueprints, LLM optimization architectures, system instructions, and generative AI guides published
        on Daily Prompt Hack are provided for technical experimentation, educational, and workflow optimization purposes
        only. Because large language models (LLMs) operate probabilistically, generative outputs may vary across
        different model checkpoints, context windows, and platform versions. Daily Prompt Hack does not guarantee
        identical outputs and shall not be held liable for API consumption costs, unexpected model hallucinations, or
        operational downtime resulting from the implementation of published frameworks.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">3. Intellectual Property & Code Snippets</h2>
      <p>
        All original editorial content, structural frameworks, and proprietary analyses on Daily Prompt Hack are
        protected by applicable copyright and intellectual property laws. Readers are permitted to execute, adapt, and
        integrate published open prompt templates and code snippets directly into their personal or commercial
        applications. However, automated scraping, uncredited republication, or whole-site syndication without explicit
        written consent is strictly prohibited.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">4. Revisions & Errata</h2>
      <p>
        As AI technologies and foundation models evolve rapidly, materials appearing on Daily Prompt Hack may include
        technical updates, typographical adjustments, or deprecated model references. We reserve the right to revise,
        improve, or update technical materials and prompt schemas at any time without prior notice.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">5. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms and conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with standard legal frameworks, and you
        irrevocably submit to the exclusive jurisdiction of the competent courts for any legal matters arising
        hereunder.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
